Yes. With that clarification, I would **de-emphasize file count completely**. If production normally has **one Prefund file and one Settlement file per processing window**, the operational unit is really the **window's transaction/value workload**, not the number of files.

The dashboard should therefore answer:

> **For this processing window, how many Prefund requests/transactions came in, what $ value is involved, how quickly were they reserved, and did Settlement successfully consume/settle them?**

The same dashboard can run with a **60-minute production window** and a **5–10 minute test window**.

