| KPI                      | What it tells Ops                |
| ------------------------ | -------------------------------- |
| **Files Received**       | Current workload                 |
| **Files Processing**     | Active workload                  |
| **Files Completed**      | Throughput                       |
| **Files Failed**         | Immediate attention              |
| **Transactions Pending** | Backlog                          |
| **Transactions Failed**  | Business exceptions              |
| **Amount Pending**       | Financial exposure               |
| **Amount at Risk**       | Failed/unresolved amount         |
| **Recovery Pending**     | Items waiting for retry/recovery |

The two most valuable additions are **Pending Amount** and **Amount at Risk**. A count of 3 failed transactions isn't meaningful if they represent $300 versus $3M.

